<title>UK: Banco de Credito Argentino sets $150 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Banco de Credito Argentino sets $150 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DE CREDITO ARGENTINO</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    24.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+283 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX/BA    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG/NY    HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  0.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT FEB 2000 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
